{
  "name": "blosc-sys",
  "description": "Low-level Rust FFI bindings for C-Blosc, a high-performance meta-compression library designed for binary data. It employs blocking and shuffling techniques to optimize for CPU cache locality, often achieving throughput exceeding standard memory copy operations. The crate automates the compilation of the underlying C library via CMake, exposing a suite of lossless compressors including LZ4, Snappy, and Zlib.",
